1
00:00:00,065 --> 00:00:02,511
Promising medicines need rigorous trials.

2
00:00:02,761 --> 00:00:05,120
Operational delays keep patients waiting.

3
00:00:05,522 --> 00:00:06,968
Meet ProtocolPulse.

4
00:00:07,217 --> 00:00:08,662
Open a trial protocol.

5
00:00:08,913 --> 00:00:12,714
AI extracts inclusion and exclusion criteria into source-linked

6
00:00:12,739 --> 00:00:13,272
rules.

7
00:00:13,739 --> 00:00:16,750
A clinical lead reviews and approves.

8
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:19,598
Screen the patient cohort.

9
00:00:19,935 --> 00:00:24,446
See potential matches, conflicts, and missing evidence.

10
00:00:24,826 --> 00:00:28,011
An order alone doesn't prove medication use.

11
00:00:28,261 --> 00:00:32,707
Confirm participation, then add a new medication record.

12
00:00:33,043 --> 00:00:35,794
Approved rules flag a conflict.

13
00:00:36,348 --> 00:00:40,163
AI investigates and drafts a cited summary.

14
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:44,881
The clinical lead reviews the evidence and records the next step.

15
00:00:45,217 --> 00:00:48,577
Less repetitive work saves teams time.

16
00:00:49,043 --> 00:00:53,062
More efficient trials could help new medicines reach the patients

17
00:00:53,087 --> 00:00:54,533
who need them sooner.

18
00:00:54,783 --> 00:00:57,990
ProtocolPulse, keep the trial moving.
